msgstr "2.0.2 (&kde; SC 4.10)"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "Take a shot"
msgstr "Napravite sliku"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>Kamoso</application> gives you an opportunity to make photos "
"from your webcam and upload them to Facebook"
msgstr ""
"<application>Kamoso</application> vam daje priliku da napravite slike sa "
"vaše kamere i stavite ih na Facebook."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Record video"
msgstr "Snimite video"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>Kamoso</application> allows to record videos from your webcam "
"and upload them to YouTube"
msgstr ""
"<application>Kamoso</application> omogućava vam da snimite vidio sa vaše "
"kamere i stavite ih na YouTube"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Guide"
msgstr "Korisnički vodič"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Welcome to <application>Kamoso</application>!"
msgstr "Dobrodošli u <application>Kamoso</application>!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>Kamoso</application> is a great program to use your webcam to "
"take pictures or make videos. It probably should be the best webcam recorder "
"for &Linux;. This guide will help you use Kamoso once you have installed it. "
"We tried to make it simple and friendly. Good luck!"
msgstr ""
"<application>Kamoso</application>je odličan program da koristite vašu web "
"kameru za pravljenje slika ili videa. Vjerovatno bi trebao biti najbolji za "
"snimanje web amerom za &Linux; Ovaj vodič će vam pomoći u korištenju Kamoso "
"kada ga instalirate. Pokušali smo napraviti ga jednostavnim i prijateljskim. "
"Sretno!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "Brzi početak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On launching <application>Kamoso</application>, you are greeted with two "
"groups of buttons on the left and right, and a button in the center."
msgstr ""
"Pri pokretanju <application>Kamoso</application>, pozdravljeni ste sa dvije "
"grupe dugmadi desno i lijevo, i drugmetom u centru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The central button helps you to click a picture! Go ahead and try it now! "
"SMILE!"
msgstr ""
"Ovo centralno dugme vam pomaže da napravite sliku! Idite i pokšajte to sada! "
"OSMIJEH!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>Kamoso</application> will give you a 3 second heads up so you "
"can pose for your picture, and ask you to smile right before clicking!"
msgstr ""
"<application>Kamoso</application> vam daje 3 sekunde prednosti da možete "
"pozirati za sliku, i traži vam da se nasmijete tačno prije klikanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you click on the second button from the left, <application>Kamoso</"
"application> changes to burst-mode. <application>Kamoso</application> will "
"keep clicking pictures rapidly till you don't click on the center button and "
"tell it to stop. The pictures line up in chronological order on the bottom, "
"and you can view them by double-clicking them. Alternatively, you could "
"right click and choose <guilabel>Open</guilabel> to view the pictures too! "
"If you aren't happy with any of the pictures, just right click and select "
"<guilabel>Trash</guilabel> to delete that particular picture."
msgstr ""
"Ako kliknete na drugo dugme lijevo, <application>Kamoso</application> "
"mijenja mod u prasak-mod. <application>Kamoso</application> će slikati brzo "
"dok ne klliknete na centralno dugme i kažete mu da prestane. Linija slika u "
"hronološkom redu je na dnu i možete ih vidjet duplim-klikom na njih. "
"Altrenativno možete kliknuti denim klikom i odabrati <guilabel>Otvori</"
"guilabel>   da vidite slike takođe! Ako niste zadovoljni ni sa jednom "
"slikom, kliknite desni klik i odaberite <guilabel>Smeće</guilabel> da "
"obrišete tu sliku."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Upload image to Facebook"
msgstr "Postavite sliku na Facebook"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you feel your newly-clicked pictures must be uploaded to your Facebook "
"profile, just right click on the picture and select <guilabel>Facebook "
"Import/Export</guilabel>. A window will open up on your browser asking you "
"to grant permission to <application>Kamoso</application>. Once you do this, "
"upload away!"
msgstr ""
"Ako mislite da vaše novo-uslikane slike moraju biti postavljene na vaš "
"Facebook profil, samo kliknite desni klik na sliku i odaberite "
"<guilabel>Facebook Import/Export</guilabel>. Otvorit će se prozor vašeg "
"pretraživaca koji vam traži odobrenje dozvole za  <application>Kamoso</"
"application>. Kada ovo uradite, samo postavite sliku!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "You need to have an account on Facebook to upload the picture you made"
msgstr ""
"Morate da imate profil na Facebooku da postavite slike koje ste napravili."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to avoid all the right clicks, click on the second button on the "
"right side and you'll be provided with the same options as when you right "
"click."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da izbjegnete svo desno klikanje, kliknite na drugo dugme na "
"desnoj strani i obezbjedit će vam se iste opcija kao i kada biste desno "
"klikali."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Upload video to YouTube"
msgstr "Postavite video na YouTube."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>Kamoso</application> also allows you to capture videos! By "
"clicking on the red button on the left, you change to video mode. Click on "
"the central button to shoot your video! Right click on the video and select "
"<guilabel>YouTube</guilabel> to upload it to YouTube."
msgstr ""
"<application>Kamoso</application> vam takođe omogućuje da snimite videe! "
"Klikom na crveno dugmo lijevo, mijenjate u video mod. Kliknite na centralno "
"dugme da snimite video. Kliknite desnim klikom na video i odaberite  "
"<guilabel>YouTube</guilabel> da ga postavite na YouTube."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You need to have an account on YouTube and provide <application>Kamoso</"
"application> an access with your username and password – don't worry, it's "
"totally safe!"
msgstr ""
"Morate da imate račun na YouTubeu i omogućite <application>Kamoso</"
"application> pristup sa vašim koriničkim imenom i šifrom - ne brinite, "
"potpuno je sigurno!"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customising"
msgstr "Prilagođavanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you feel your picture quality isn't optimal, click on the button on the "
"extreme right and select <guilabel>Settings</guilabel>. This is the settings "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"Ako mislite da kvaliteta vaše slike nije optimalna, kliknite na najljevlje "
"dugme i odaberite <guilabel>Postavke</guilabel>. Ovo je panel postavki."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to change the directory where <application>Kamoso</application> "
"saves the pictures, navigate to the <guilabel>General</guilabel> panel, and "
"change the directory from thereon."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da promijenite direktorij gdje <application>Kamoso</application> "
"sprema slike, idite na  <guilabel>Generalno</guilabel> panel, i promijenite "
"direktorij odatle."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to change the time before <application>Kamoso</application> "
"clicks your picture, navigate to <guilabel>Photo settings</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da pormijenite vrijeme prije nego <application>Kamoso</"
"application> napravi sliku, otiđite na <guilabel>Postavke slike</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you're a really technical user, scroll over to the <guilabel>Video "
"settings</guilabel> and there you can adjust settings like brightness, "
"contrast, &etc;"
msgstr ""
"Ako ste zaista tehnički korisnik, skrolujte do  <guilabel>Video postavke</"
"guilabel> i tamo prilagodite postavke kao svjetlost, kontrast, &etc;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "The End"
msgstr "Kraj"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Well, we've reached the end of our tutorial. I hope your queries have been "
"adequately answered!"
msgstr ""
"Dakle, došli smo do kraja ovog tutorijala. Nadamo se da su vaša pitanje "
"adekvatno odgovorena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enjoy using <application>Kamoso</application>!"
msgstr "Uživajte kroisteći <application>Kamoso</application>!"

